<h1>forest</h1>
<p>
(definition)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
A collection of one or more <a href="tree.html"><em>trees</em></a>.
</p>

<p>
<strong>Formal Definition:</strong> An <a href="undirectedGraph.html"><em>undirected</em></a>, <a href="acyclicgraph.html"><em>acyclic graph</em></a>.
</p>
<p>
<strong>See also</strong>
<a href="connectedGraph.html"><em>connected graph</em></a>.
</p>

<p>
<em>Note:
Different <a href="vertex.html"><em>vertices</em></a> of a forest need not be connected.</em>
</p>

<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPEB">PEB</a></p>

